@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin / Teknisi" as User
boundary "Halaman\nPelanggan" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Customers" as DB
participant "MikroTik\nRouter" as MT

== Lihat Daftar Pelanggan ==

User -> UI : Buka menu Pelanggan
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/customers
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil daftar pelanggan
activate DB
DB --> System : Daftar pelanggan
deactivate DB

System --> UI : 200 OK + data
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Tampilkan tabel pelanggan
deactivate UI

== Tambah Pelanggan Baru ==

User -> UI : Klik Tambah & input data\n(Nama, No. HP, Alamat)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/customers
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi kelengkapan data
System -> DB : Cek duplikasi (email/no HP)
activate DB
DB --> System : Status unik/duplikat
deactivate DB

alt Data Sudah Terdaftar
    System --> UI : Error: Data sudah terdaftar
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Data Unik & Valid
    System -> DB : INSERT customers
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Kembalikan customer_id
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 201 Created
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Pelanggan berhasil ditambahkan
    deactivate UI
end

== Ubah Data Pelanggan ==

User -> UI : Pilih pelanggan & klik Edit
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/customers/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data pelanggan by ID
activate DB
DB --> System : Data pelanggan
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data pelanggan
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Tampilkan form edit
deactivate UI

User -> UI : Ubah data & klik Simpan
activate UI
UI -> System : PUT /api/customers/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi data baru
alt Data Tidak Valid
    System --> UI : Error: Data tidak valid
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Data Valid
    System -> DB : UPDATE customers
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Data pelanggan diperbarui
    deactivate UI
end

== Hapus Pelanggan ==

User -> UI : Pilih pelanggan & klik Hapus
activate UI
UI -> System : DELETE /api/customers/:id
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Cek langganan aktif
activate DB
DB --> System : Jumlah langganan aktif
deactivate DB

alt Masih Memiliki Langganan Aktif
    System --> UI : Error: Masih ada\nlangganan aktif
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Nonaktifkan langganan dulu
    deactivate UI
else Tidak Ada Langganan Aktif
    System -> MT : Hapus PPP Secret terkait
    activate MT
    MT --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : Soft delete customer
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Pelanggan berhasil dihapus
    deactivate UI
end

== Aktivasi Layanan ==

User -> UI : Pilih pelanggan &\nklik Aktifkan Layanan
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/customers/:id/activate
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data pelanggan\n& profil bandwidth
activate DB
DB --> System : Data profil
deactivate DB

System -> System : Generate kredensial PPPoE
System -> MT : Buat PPP Secret di router
activate MT

alt Koneksi Router Gagal
    MT --> System : Error: timeout
    deactivate MT
    System --> UI : Warning: Router tidak\ndapat dihubungi
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Perlu sinkronisasi manual
    deactivate UI
else Router Berhasil
    MT --> System : PPP Secret dibuat
    deactivate MT

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = active
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Layanan aktif
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Kredensial PPPoE dikirim
    deactivate UI
end

note right of User
  CRUD: Create, Read, Update, Delete.
  Aktivasi: Buat PPP Secret di MikroTik.
  Soft delete: ditandai deleted_at.
end note

@enduml